  "sourceTitle": "Rye Pancakes",
  "sourceText": "Rye Pancakes\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 11:33am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 Eggs, beaten\ncup Molasses\ncup Milk\n3 cups Rye flour\n2 tablespoons Nutritional yeast\n1 teaspoon Salt\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Blend eggs, molasses and milk. Sift remaining ingredients together and stir into liquid mixture. Drop spoonfuls onto hot oiled pan or griddle. Brown lightly on both sides. 2 Serves 6.",
